; Shotgun alt-fire — "Double Barrel". 18 hitscan pellets in a single
; trigger pull — a one-cast burst that fires both barrels at once. Costs
; 2 ammo (gated at fire-time via Skill.ammo_cost). Same per-pellet damage
; as Buckshot, but double the pellet count means catastrophic damage at
; close range and a magazine that empties in 4 trigger pulls instead of
; 8. Slightly slower cooldown reflects the heavier kick.

